ember of her clan, Mirai Kuriyama is cursed with the terrifying ability to control and manipulate blood, a power so heretical that she is shunned even by those with the ability to understand her \"gift\". Akihito Kanbara is only half human, but while the monstrous other half of his lineage seems to have doomed him to a life alone, it has also given him near invulnerability in the form of rapid healing. Alone, their futures seem bleak, but when a chance encounter brings them together, it becomes clear that they share more than just an unexpected bond. Together they share a destiny and a mission that only the two of them together may be strong enough to survive.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Demons","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":67,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":63,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":56,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School Club","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Exorcism","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Idol","rank":26,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Beyond the Boundary","english":"Beyond the Boundary","native":"境界の彼方","romaji":"Kyoukai no Kanata","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"境界的彼方"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"きょうかいのかなた"}]},"trailer":{"id":"BnfeVrAAS2k","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BnfeVrAA